      "content": "The concept of biochemical manipulation to bypass willpower is a staple of science fiction, but its implementation in a retail setting is purely speculative at this point. Hiding advanced aerosolization technology within standard HVAC equipment would require a high degree of sophisticated, clandestine modification. Ultimately, leveraging proven psychological tactics like prime placement and scent is far less risky and more practically effective for maximizing sales than attempting to engineer unnoticed neurochemical influence.",
